+ * Samsung Shannon CP integrated in Exynos SoCs (e.g. Exynos 8895), driven
+ * by the mainline port of Samsung's modem_v1 driver ("mif_sipc5"): AT
+ * port on the WWAN subsystem, raw-IP rmnet net ports.
